    "body": "FWIW, the [CSS Text spec](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-text-3/#boundary-shaping) makes this explicit:\r\n\r\n> Text shaping _must_ be broken at inline box boundaries  when any of the following are true [...]\r\n> * The  boundary is a bidi isolation boundary.",
